{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24409","headline":"戏赠梦得兼呈思黯 · 白居易","name":"戏赠梦得兼呈思黯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜鬓莫欺今老矣，一杯莫笑便陶然。\n陈郎中处爲高户，裴使君前作少年。\n顾我独狂多自哂，与君同病最相怜。\n月终斋满谁开素，须拟奇章置一筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}